{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13028","headline":"关羽祠送高员外还荆州 · 郎士元","name":"关羽祠送高员外还荆州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军禀天姿，义勇冠今昔。\n走马百战场，一剑万人敌。\n虽爲感恩者，竟是思归客。\n流落荆巫间，裴回故乡隔。\n离筵对祠宇，洒酒暮天碧。\n去去勿复言，衔悲向陈迹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}